Appendix C: Suggested KPIs for monitoring
- AUROC & AUPRC on rolling window (7/30/90 day)
- Calibration drift (Brier score, calibration curve)
- Prediction distribution changes (population shift)
- Decision impact metrics (interventions delivered, avoidable readmissions prevented)

