Concluding remarks
This consolidated DOC provides a full technical narrative and recommended roadmap for converting the current repository into a fully reproducible, production-ready analytics pipeline. The key missing piece is the dataset itself; once data is centralized and sample extracts added to data/raw/, the recommended notebooks and pipelines can be executed to produce reproducible EDA, models, and evaluation reports.

